---
description: >-
  Verifies the today marker is shown by default (no explicit
  todayMarker directive) with a task ending exactly on the test-clock
  "today" date.
---
gantt
  title Show today marker (vertical line should be visible)
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat %d
  %% Should default to being on
  %% todayMarker on
  section Section1
  Yesterday: 1010-10-09, 1d
  Today: 1010-10-10, 1d
